# treadle 1
type crt class
	namespace C
	static
	doc "The C functions the core library calls: libc (UCRT), kernel32 and the runtime's own (treadle_rt: the command line, files and directories, number parsing and formats, UTF-8, the environment, processes, the calendar clock). Written by hand; the core's Sheets reach them as C.crt.<name>."

